      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I now realize help.vrchat.com competes with docs.vrchat.com and has a page:\nhttps://help.vrchat.com/kb/article/24-i-want-to-turn-my-steam-oculus-account-into-a-vrchat-account/\nI still think a comprehensive document like the 2FA one would be ideal.\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/setup-2fa",
